    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents are delighted to present 12 The Kybe, Skerries, Co. Dublin to the open market for sale. \n\nThis well-positioned three-bedroom mid-terrace home is ideally located in the heart of Skerries, within walking distance of an excellent range of local amenities, the beautiful South Strand beach, public transport links, and all the attractions of this vibrant coastal town.\n\nOffered with vacant possession and ready for an immediate closing (subject to probate which is process), the property presents an excellent opportunity for purchasers to modernise and personalise to their own style and requirements, creating a wonderful home in one of North Dublin`s most sought-after locations.\n\nThe accommodation benefits from bright, well-proportioned living spaces, while the private, sunny rear garden provides an ideal setting for outdoor enjoyment. Whether you are a first-time buyer seeking a starter home, an investor, or a downsizer looking for convenience and comfort, this property is sure to appeal thanks to its superb location and excellent potential.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises: entrance hallway, living room, kitchen/dining area, three bedrooms, and family bathroom.\n\nLocation: The Kybe is a mature and well-established residential development conveniently located within walking distance of Skerries town centre. Residents can enjoy an array of local amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, sports clubs, and recreational facilities. The town`s picturesque south-facing beach, harbour, and scenic coastal walks are all nearby. Skerries also benefits from excellent transport connections, with regular rail services to Dublin City Centre and easy access to the M1, Dublin Airport, and surrounding areas, making it an ideal location for commuters and families alike.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 1.53m (5'0\") x 1.27m (4'2\")\n-With carpet\n\nLounge - 4.64m (15'3\") x 4.83m (15'10\")\n-With carpet\n-Ceiling coving\n-Feature open fireplace with marble hearth and timber surround\n\n\nKitchen/Diner - 4.63m (15'2\") x 3.7m (12'2\")\n-With carpet\n-With a range of matching floor and eye level fitted press units\n-Integrated appliances\n-Tiled splashbacks\n-Door to rear garden\n\nFirst Floor Landing\n-With carpet\n-Hotpress \n-Access to attic\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.64m (15'3\") x 2.56m (8'5\")\n-With carpet \n-Built in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.46m (8'1\") x 3.88m (12'9\")\n-With carpet \n-Built in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.07m (6'9\") x 2.95m (9'8\")\n-With carpet \n-Built in wardrobe\n\nBathroom - 2.73m (8'11\") x 1.98m (6'6\")\n-Fully tiled\n-WC and WHB\n-Shower cubicle\n-Heated towel rail\n\n"
      },
